// Card-only economy tuning for Aeonrift: Ascendancy.
//
// The champion roster (content/champions) carries ONLY combat data; everything that
// turns a champion into a *card* (its elixir cost band) is tuned here. `power_divisor`
// converts a champion's raw power score into an elixir cost; `min_cost`/`max_cost`
// clamp it to the Clash-style 1..=10 band.
//
// NOTE: these mirror the compiled-in defaults in src/cards/card.rs so the default
// build needs no file IO to price a card; `load_card_tuning` lets tools/tests read
// the same numbers from data.
CardTuning(
    power_divisor: 300,
    min_cost: 1,
    max_cost: 10,
)
